Yes, it's for weapons and armors as well as normal items. As for it being XP... Add this to the script editor:
Code:
class Game_Party
  def init_all_items
    @items = {}
    @weapons = {}
    @armors = {}
  end
end
Neither solution previously offered would work in XP, but mine will if that is present.
As for the self switches thing, the easiest way is just to redo $game_self_switches. So use this:
Code:
$game_self_switches = Game_SelfSwitches.new

